# david_glass_crypt is a required Crypt:3 ending; its float MAP shapes the
# final floor.
# The source directives keep keyed terrain such as iron_grate, alarm and Lua
# decisions at arm_grates, bonus_loot with this map.
NAME:   david_glass_crypt
ORIENT: float
TAGS:   no_item_gen no_rotate transparent
PLACE:  Crypt:$
MARKER: m = lua:portal_desc {wall_phase = 1}
KFEAT:  m = iron_grate
KMASK:  1 = opaque
MONS:   patrolling lich w:20 / patrolling ancient lich / patrolling dread lich
MONS:   bone dragon / curse skull / curse toe
MONS:   flying skull / skeletal warrior / skeleton
MONS:   ancient champion
KMONS:  F = orange crystal statue / obsidian statue
KITEM:  | = | no_pickup
KFEAT:  ^ = alarm trap
SUBST:  3 = 3., F = G:99 F:1
: vault.run("arm_grates")
NSUBST:  %| = 1:d / 1:h
: vault.run("bonus_loot")
MAP
.....................
.....................
..vvvvnnnnnnnnnvvvv..
..vlllllllllllllllv..
..vlllllllllllllllv..
..vllll.%|||%.llllv..
.4vll..%|||||%..llv4.
..vl....%|||%....lv..
..vmm...........mmv..
..v1m..F.vvv.F..m1v..
..v1m...^^^^^...m1v..
..vvvvvvv+++vvvvvvv..
...vv..2..4..2..vv...
 ..vv.333333333.vv..
 ...vvv.......vvv...
   ...vv+++++vv...
    .............
ENDMAP
